  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways for Better Education and Livelihoods in North of Central America</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways for Better Education and Livelihood in North of Central America (NCA)  - Honduras and El Salvador&apos; supports AE Programs, psychosocial support, life-skills development, and assets provision for displacement affected youth, and strengthen youth involvement within the community. Also in  focus is youth accessing educational opportunities to enhance life skills and employment. Main partners will include the MoE of Honduras and the National Foundation for the Development of Honduras (FUNADEH).</narrative>
  </description>
